post-it: Take a closer look at the super computer
symptoms:
	No parts in the computer
	Works without any parts
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Remount the shell
notes:
	NO PARTS: no issues, all parts missing, works anyway. The repair is to open the computer and close it again; it stays empty and keeps running.
	Corruption, which CompuFunDB does not diagnose: it finds nothing for these symptoms.
	No parts in the computer: opened, the case is empty: no motherboard, CPU, fan, RAM, GPU or hard drive.
	Works without any parts: it switches on and boots into Windows, on Cambion.
